1
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:38,210
[First Love Again]

2
00:01:38,390 --> 00:01:40,930
[Episode 22]

3
00:01:41,030 --> 00:01:48,530
[Pathology Department]

4
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:45,210
Does Gu Han really
just have fluid in his knee?

5
00:01:45,950 --> 00:01:46,710
Yeah.

6
00:01:47,229 --> 00:01:47,840
Yes.

7
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:54,750
[Blood Transfusion Department]
[Clinical Laboratory]

8
00:01:48,789 --> 00:01:49,400
Yes.

9
00:01:50,350 --> 00:01:50,950
Okay then.

10
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:53,070
If I take him to another hospital
for a checkup,

11
00:01:53,070 --> 00:01:55,270
and his injury worsens after the match,

12
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:57,430
I'll sue you, Ao Ziyi, for a misdiagnosis.

13
00:01:57,430 --> 00:01:58,830
Is Gu Han still training?

14
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,870
He trains every day

15
00:02:00,950 --> 00:02:02,680
just for the match in a few days.

16
00:02:05,590 --> 00:02:08,240
When he was admitted to the hospital
to get a check-up for his injury,

17
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:10,030
he asked us to keep his condition a secret

18
00:02:10,030 --> 00:02:12,160
so that he could stabilize the morale.

19
00:02:15,430 --> 00:02:17,290
He promised us he would rest well.

20
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:19,680
So what is the real situation?

21
00:02:20,150 --> 00:02:22,280
I know he takes painkillers every day.

22
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:25,970
But when I ask him,
he refuses to tell me anything.

23
00:02:27,430 --> 00:02:29,090
I'm really worried about him.

24
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,400
Dr. Ao.

25
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:34,840
Can you tell me the truth?

26
00:02:42,310 --> 00:02:43,910
When the doctor made a diagnosis,

27
00:02:43,910 --> 00:02:46,079
his knee effusion was already very severe.

28
00:02:46,079 --> 00:02:47,630
If he continues to train,

29
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:50,200
it may cause damage
to his patellar tendon,

30
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:50,910
or even

31
00:02:51,430 --> 00:02:52,520
rupture it.

32
00:02:54,710 --> 00:02:55,850
He also asked the doctor

33
00:02:55,850 --> 00:02:57,840
when he could return to the playing field.

34
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:58,700
The doctor said

35
00:02:58,870 --> 00:03:01,870
he should try not to do sports
for three to five months.

36
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,000
Okay.

37
00:03:05,030 --> 00:03:05,870
I got it.

38
00:03:08,670 --> 00:03:11,980
[Surgical Department] [Lobby]
[Special Examination Department]

39
00:03:19,210 --> 00:03:20,430
[Lobby] [Special Examination Department]

40
00:03:24,750 --> 00:03:25,870
I asked the doctor

41
00:03:26,030 --> 00:03:27,490
to downplay my condition.

42
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:31,520
I also didn't want anyone to worry,

43
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,710
so I asked Tian

44
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:34,360
to keep it from everyone.

45
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,690
You even kept it from me.

46
00:03:37,430 --> 00:03:38,120
I'm sorry.

47
00:03:38,710 --> 00:03:40,150
I didn't want you to worry.

48
00:03:40,150 --> 00:03:42,400
How could I possibly not worry?

49
00:03:43,079 --> 00:03:44,470
You're injured so badly.

50
00:03:44,470 --> 00:03:46,730
But Tian has still let you play the match.

51
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:52,480
I don't want to have any regrets.

52
00:03:57,079 --> 00:03:58,480
What if during the match,

53
00:03:58,520 --> 00:04:00,080
something bad really happens to you?

54
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,410
What should you do then?

55
00:04:09,910 --> 00:04:10,640
Don't worry.

56
00:04:11,590 --> 00:04:12,710
What the doctor said

57
00:04:12,710 --> 00:04:14,570
is just the worst-case scenario.

58
00:04:14,590 --> 00:04:17,250
Haven't I been resting well
these past two days?

59
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:18,980
I will have a good rest.

60
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:23,660
Stop worrying.

61
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:36,390
Alright.

62
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:39,430
That's all for the tactical analysis

63
00:04:39,430 --> 00:04:40,630
for Xinya University.

64
00:04:40,630 --> 00:04:42,190
Does anyone have any questions?

65
00:04:42,190 --> 00:04:43,510
No.

66
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:44,460
Dismissed.

67
00:04:45,270 --> 00:04:46,680
Review the tactics carefully.

68
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,110
Got it.

69
00:04:47,140 --> 00:04:47,540
Got it.

70
00:04:47,570 --> 00:04:48,430
-Got it.
-Got it.

71
00:04:48,430 --> 00:04:49,070
Got it.

72
00:04:52,430 --> 00:04:53,040
Gu Han.

73
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:55,040
Come here.

74
00:04:59,830 --> 00:05:00,510
I know that

75
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,870
once you've made up your mind,

76
00:05:02,870 --> 00:05:04,070
I can't dissuade you.

77
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:06,600
But you have to think it through.

78
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:07,660
With your ability,

79
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:09,360
you are very likely to become

80
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:12,040
an excellent professional player
in the future.

81
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:14,000
But if you suffer an irreversible injury,

82
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,870
it will affect you
for the rest of your life.

83
00:05:15,870 --> 00:05:17,470
You have to think it through.

84
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:18,120
Tian.

85
00:05:19,190 --> 00:05:20,650
If I don't fight for it now,

86
00:05:20,830 --> 00:05:22,760
what future is there to talk about?

87
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,040
Okay.

88
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:31,270
I'll let you play in the next match.

89
00:05:32,310 --> 00:05:33,430
But let's be clear.

90
00:05:33,830 --> 00:05:34,890
I'm the head coach.

91
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:36,830
If I notice any problems,

92
00:05:36,830 --> 00:05:38,690
I will have you subbed at any time.

93
00:05:38,830 --> 00:05:40,159
You have to listen to me.

94
00:05:41,510 --> 00:05:42,120
Got it.

95
00:05:44,430 --> 00:05:45,830
Alright. Go ahead.

96
00:05:53,270 --> 00:05:55,480
Why has he
been in such a bad state lately?

97
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:56,630
We lost all our recent group matches

98
00:05:56,630 --> 00:05:58,040
because of his bad state.

99
00:05:58,750 --> 00:06:00,830
His injury obviously hasn't healed yet.

100
00:06:00,830 --> 00:06:03,920
I just don't know how we're going to
play in the semifinal.

101
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:05,560
He even said he was fine.

102
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:07,400
He definitely wants to play.

103
00:06:07,630 --> 00:06:08,630
But to be honest,

104
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:09,870
in terms of this situation,

105
00:06:09,870 --> 00:06:11,920
if he plays,
he'll become our weak point instead.

106
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:13,800
We'll even have to help him on defense.

107
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:14,720
Yeah.

108
00:06:15,070 --> 00:06:16,920
I can't even mark my own man.

109
00:06:25,780 --> 00:06:27,710
[Jiangcheng University
Sports and Cultural Center]

110
00:06:27,780 --> 00:06:33,900
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

111
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:36,580
Do you know what you're doing?

112
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:39,780
Do you know the consequences?

113
00:07:42,630 --> 00:07:43,950
The doctor said

114
00:07:44,159 --> 00:07:45,720
you might tear your patellar tendon.

115
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:48,180
Yet you're still secretly practicing here?

116
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,890
The semifinal is coming up.

117
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:56,370
I don't want to become everyone's burden.

118
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:59,360
I've been waiting for almost four years.

119
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:01,020
These are my last two matches.

120
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:04,060
I have no reason to give up.

121
00:08:10,510 --> 00:08:12,640
You can give it up for your girlfriend.

122
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:15,520
Can that be considered a reason?

123
00:08:36,669 --> 00:08:38,630
Do you think I'm very selfish?

124
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:44,240
Just assume I'm selfish, okay?

125
00:08:44,750 --> 00:08:46,720
I really don't want to
see you be like this.

126
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,840
I don't want to see you ruin your

127
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:51,440
entire career just because of one match.

128
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,440
Nor do I want to see

129
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:54,300
the rest of your life be affected.

130
00:08:58,150 --> 00:08:59,390
Just do it for me.

131
00:09:00,790 --> 00:09:01,960
Just do it for me.

132
00:09:03,510 --> 00:09:05,320
Don't play anymore, okay?

133
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:26,930
Xiangxiang.

134
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:28,870
I'm sorry.

135
00:09:42,510 --> 00:09:43,120
Okay.

136
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,210
Xiangxiang.

137
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:46,690
Xiangxiang.

138
00:10:35,370 --> 00:10:37,480
[Gu Han]

139
00:11:00,520 --> 00:11:04,230
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

140
00:11:06,690 --> 00:11:09,090
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

141
00:11:30,390 --> 00:11:31,440
I'm sorry, Director.

142
00:11:30,760 --> 00:11:35,740
[Director Zhang of 24s]

143
00:11:31,790 --> 00:11:34,600
Regarding the live stream of the semifinal
between JCU and Xinya,

144
00:11:34,600 --> 00:11:36,270
can I swap with someone else?

145
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:39,670
[Director Zhang]

146
00:11:40,550 --> 00:11:41,280
Xiangxiang.

147
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:44,320
What's wrong?

148
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:47,360
You've been acting weird
since you got up this morning.

149
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:47,960
Nothing.

150
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:49,200
Let's go.

151
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:55,120
There are no classes this afternoon.
What will you do?

152
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:56,380
I haven't decided yet.

153
00:12:01,870 --> 00:12:02,480
Good shot!

154
00:12:03,630 --> 00:12:04,200
Nice!

155
00:12:04,790 --> 00:12:06,650
Get in your defensive positions!

156
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:17,270
Help Gu Han out! Hurry!

157
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,580
Watch your positions!

158
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:24,280
Keep running!

159
00:12:26,590 --> 00:12:34,470
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

160
00:12:29,790 --> 00:12:31,450
Alright. That's it for today.

161
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:32,940
Come here. Gather around.

162
00:12:38,260 --> 00:12:39,470
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

163
00:12:51,630 --> 00:12:52,890
The match is coming up.

164
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:54,960
Guys, just practice harder.

165
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:56,720
-Got it?
-Got it.

166
00:12:56,750 --> 00:12:57,600
Got it.

167
00:12:57,750 --> 00:12:58,950
Alright. Dismissed.

168
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:04,610
How are you? Can you continue?

169
00:13:04,610 --> 00:13:05,420
No problem.

170
00:13:06,790 --> 00:13:08,450
Don't push yourself too hard.

171
00:13:32,390 --> 00:13:35,010
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

172
00:14:09,360 --> 00:14:12,090
[JCU Campus TV Station]

173
00:14:17,240 --> 00:14:17,970
Xiangxiang.

174
00:14:22,980 --> 00:14:26,140
[JCU Campus TV Station]

175
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:23,850
Xiangxiang.

176
00:14:25,790 --> 00:14:26,520
Xiangxiang!

177
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:29,000
Senior.

178
00:14:29,670 --> 00:14:30,440
Are you okay?

179
00:14:31,030 --> 00:14:31,720
I'm fine.

180
00:14:33,790 --> 00:14:36,190
Don't you have to
go to the Starry Sky today?

181
00:14:36,510 --> 00:14:37,740
It's my turn to take a day off today.

182
00:14:37,740 --> 00:14:39,910
[JCU Campus TV Station]

183
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:41,480
I heard Gu Han injured his knee.

184
00:14:41,510 --> 00:14:42,840
How is it? Is it serious?

185
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:53,340
Our captain is already like this.

186
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,840
Are we going too far?

187
00:14:55,160 --> 00:14:56,600
Do you think I want this?

188
00:14:57,510 --> 00:14:59,110
Didn't you hear Tian say that

189
00:14:59,150 --> 00:15:01,000
he has severe knee effusion

190
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:03,030
and even his patellar tendon is damaged?

191
00:15:03,030 --> 00:15:04,160
If he keeps playing,

192
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:06,100
it will be completely ruined.

193
00:15:07,840 --> 00:15:10,370
Why don't we
try to dissuade our captain again

194
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:12,200
or think of another way?

195
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:14,320
Constantly isolating him like this
isn't a solution.

196
00:15:14,320 --> 00:15:15,270
With his stubbornness,

197
00:15:15,270 --> 00:15:16,870
which of us can dissuade him?

198
00:15:17,440 --> 00:15:19,240
Now we must stick it out to the end

199
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:20,030
and make him realize that

200
00:15:20,030 --> 00:15:22,270
if he plays the match,
he'll become everyone's burden.

201
00:15:22,270 --> 00:15:25,200
Only then might he give up
making a comeback earlier.

202
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:26,240
To be honest,

203
00:15:26,390 --> 00:15:28,390
we've finally made it to the semifinal,

204
00:15:28,390 --> 00:15:29,750
and if our captain isn't here,

205
00:15:29,750 --> 00:15:31,680
I would really have no confidence.

206
00:15:36,550 --> 00:15:38,150
You're all such good actors.

207
00:15:39,870 --> 00:15:40,510
Captain.

208
00:15:40,550 --> 00:15:41,240
Captain.

209
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:42,870
Captain.

210
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:44,150
I'm sorry.

211
00:15:45,150 --> 00:15:46,950
Captain, please don't be angry.

212
00:15:49,030 --> 00:15:50,960
We understand that you want to win.

213
00:15:51,270 --> 00:15:52,630
We want to win, too.

214
00:15:53,790 --> 00:15:55,120
But are you really okay?

215
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:02,910
If you really want what's best for me,

216
00:16:02,910 --> 00:16:05,240
then just go all out on the field.

217
00:16:21,390 --> 00:16:23,890
[Gongxing Building]

218
00:16:22,670 --> 00:16:23,750
The doctor said his injury

219
00:16:23,750 --> 00:16:25,550
might have irreversible risks.

220
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:28,860
But he insists on
playing the upcoming matches.

221
00:16:29,750 --> 00:16:31,200
I've tried very hard to dissuade him.

222
00:16:31,200 --> 00:16:32,660
But he just didn't listen.

223
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:35,360
I got anxious and just...

224
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:37,730
Xiangxiang.

225
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:41,300
No matter what decision Gu Han makes,

226
00:16:41,320 --> 00:16:42,790
and no matter how angry you are,

227
00:16:42,790 --> 00:16:44,650
you still want to help him, right?

228
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:48,150
But I don't want to see him suffer.

229
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:50,240
Of course.

230
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:53,640
Do you still remember

231
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:55,960
the idea I came up with for you
when you were preparing to

232
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:57,960
interview Gu Han for the first time?

233
00:17:00,030 --> 00:17:02,360
You mean avoiding direct confrontation?

234
00:17:04,109 --> 00:17:04,720
Yes.

235
00:17:34,070 --> 00:17:35,000
Here, Captain.

236
00:17:36,110 --> 00:17:37,440
W-What is this?

237
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:39,400
My mom is visiting me these days.

238
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:41,440
She heard
our captain had injured his knee,

239
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:43,110
so she specially
made this Beef Knee Bone Soup.

240
00:17:43,110 --> 00:17:44,830
It helps with the recovery
of knee injuries.

241
00:17:44,830 --> 00:17:46,490
Why don't you try it, Captain?

242
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:52,550
Captain, please don't be angry anymore.

243
00:17:52,550 --> 00:17:54,350
We're apologizing to you, okay?

244
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:56,100
Here. Drink it while it's hot.

245
00:17:58,440 --> 00:17:59,680
Taste it.

246
00:18:01,720 --> 00:18:02,920
Thank your mom for me.

247
00:18:02,960 --> 00:18:05,480
It's fine.
No need to stand on ceremony with my mom.

248
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:06,160
Be quick.

249
00:18:06,830 --> 00:18:08,690
Be quick. Drink it while it's hot.

250
00:18:22,400 --> 00:18:24,340
Did you say it as we had planned?

251
00:18:25,030 --> 00:18:25,830
Don't worry.

252
00:18:25,830 --> 00:18:27,110
I told him my mom made it.

253
00:18:27,110 --> 00:18:29,440
He just drank it without a second thought.

254
00:18:32,270 --> 00:18:33,030
Xiangxiang.

255
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:36,640
What has been going on
with you and the captain lately?

256
00:18:40,030 --> 00:18:42,430
Is it because
he's training with an injury?

257
00:18:44,550 --> 00:18:45,950
That's understandable.

258
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:47,310
You know his personality, too.

259
00:18:47,310 --> 00:18:48,750
He's very persistent.

260
00:18:49,110 --> 00:18:50,030
But don't worry.

261
00:18:50,030 --> 00:18:52,830
Tian and I will try to
limit his physical matchups.

262
00:18:55,880 --> 00:18:56,790
Stop worrying.

263
00:18:56,830 --> 00:18:58,760
I'll tell you if anything happens.

264
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:00,110
Thank you.

265
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:02,280
You're welcome. Bye bye.

266
00:19:12,700 --> 00:19:15,790
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

267
00:19:23,670 --> 00:19:25,280
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

268
00:19:36,830 --> 00:19:38,160
What are you doing here?

269
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:40,680
I'm...

270
00:19:41,070 --> 00:19:42,130
here to talk to you.

271
00:19:44,240 --> 00:19:45,840
I ran into Xiangxiang today.

272
00:19:46,070 --> 00:19:47,600
She didn't seem very happy.

273
00:19:48,830 --> 00:19:49,510
I know.

274
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:51,680
She's still mad at me.

275
00:19:53,110 --> 00:19:55,270
Xiangxiang isn't mad at you.

276
00:19:55,680 --> 00:19:57,540
She's just too worried about you.

277
00:20:00,240 --> 00:20:01,550
She wants you to win this championship

278
00:20:01,550 --> 00:20:03,000
