556
00:33:07,980 --> 00:33:12,630
[Live:
UBA—University Basketball Association]

557
00:33:10,030 --> 00:33:11,680
JCU! JCU!

558
00:33:11,720 --> 00:33:14,450
Xiangxiang! Xiangxiang!
It's time to wrap it up.

559
00:33:16,680 --> 00:33:18,110
Thank you all for watching.

560
00:33:18,110 --> 00:33:19,640
Our 24s program team

561
00:33:19,680 --> 00:33:20,880
